  <running_head>Johannem Dupanium.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>&amp;</catchword>
    <signature>V 2</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">ad seculares judices suæ Religioni fa-</l>
    <l n="2">ventes: nec immerito; nam illa pro-</l>
    <l n="3">vocatio à Synodis ad curias civiles,</l>
    <l n="4">quatenus subjicit. Jurisdictionem Ec-</l>
    <l n="5">clesiasticam Civili, eatenus dicit illam</l>
    <l n="6">jurisdictionem nomine tenus esse Ec-</l>
    <l n="7">clesiasticam, cujus supremum tribunal</l>
    <l n="8">est politicum:</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">10. In eo etiam iniquitas ejusmodi</l>
    <l n="10">tribunalium se prodit, quod non so-</l>
    <l n="11">lum, ut dixi, se tueantur ad eorum</l>
    <l n="12">constitutionem jure Divino, &amp; po-</l>
    <l n="13">testate ligandi &amp; solvendi, quam Ec-</l>
    <l n="14">clesiasticam &amp; spiritualem aiunt &amp; vo-</l>
    <l n="15">cant, &amp; habent seorsim à potestate aut</l>
    <l n="16">magistratus, aut vindicum disciplinæ</l>
    <l n="17">confœderatæ, sed &amp; retineant separa-</l>
    <l n="18">tim à potestate Verbi, ad quam solam</l>
    <l n="19">pertinent claves regni Cœlorum &amp; po-</l>
    <l n="20">testas ligandi &amp; solvendi, cum tamen</l>
    <l n="21">affirment per virtutem &amp; potestatem</l>
    <l n="22">illam verbi divini quæ transfert à te-</l>
    <l n="23">nebris ad lucem, &amp; à potestate satan-</l>
    <l n="24">æ ad Deum, &amp; peccatores compedibus</l>
    <l n="25">&amp; vinculis peccati solvit: cum tamen,</l>
    <l n="26">inquam, affirment per eam immori-</l>
    <l n="27">geros traditione satanæ, excommuni-</l>
    <l n="28">catione, suspensione, exauthoratione &amp;</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
